---
name: eno/shell
desc: a session shell for a machine
make: cargo build --release && mkdir -p .eno/make/bin && rm -f .eno/make/bin/eno-shell && cp target/release/eno-shell .eno/make/bin/eno-shell
run: .eno/make/bin/eno-shell
test: cargo test
---

## Dotting

```yaml eno.dot.spec
shell:
  default: run
  opts:
    '-h, --help': {desc: show this help, flag: true}
    '-c, --command':
      desc: the script to run (required for `run`)
      required: true
      scope: [session]
    '--conf':
      desc: 'the script session conf (default: $ENO_SHELL_CONF, else <host>/shell.eno)'
      scope: [session, daemon]
  verbs:
    run:
      desc: run a script in the session shell
      group: session
    enter:
      desc: enter a machine from the shell conf (ENO_CONF)
      group: machine
      args:
        - {name: name, desc: 'the machine name (ENO_CONF `shell.<name>`)'}
      opts:
        '--keep': {desc: leave the space up when the shell exits, flag: true}
    stop:
      desc: stop the session daemon
      group: daemon
    serve:
      desc: run the session daemon (internal; spawned by run)
      group: daemon
```
